gh to eat the next kind of matter. This update answers that, and fixes a few things you reported.A new colour for every new mealEach time your hole grows big enough to eat a new kind of matter, the camera pulls back with a small jolt and the glowing ring around the hole takes a new colour. It starts violet, then moves through blue, cyan, green and yellow to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T20:31:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034112","verified_at":"2026-10-22T23:29:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5071280-1845383656391161","game_id":"steam-5071280","kind":"announcement","title":"Languages, languages, languages","summary":"The Infall demo now speaks 30 languages. Twenty-two new ones join the eight it launched with, and the full game launches with all thirty on November 10.All thirtyEnglish · Türkçe · Deutsch · Français · Español (España) · Español (Latinoamérica) · Português (Brasil) · Português (Portugal) · Русский · Українська · 简体中文 · 繁體中文 · 日本語 · 한국어 · Polski · Italiano · Nederlands · Čeština · Magyar · Română · Svenska · Dansk · Norsk bokmål · Suomi · Ελληνικά · Български · ไทย · Tiếng Việt · Bahasa Indonesia","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T12:10:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656391161","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:25:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5071280-1844751498225893","game_id":"steam-5071280","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: a longer demo, abilities that aim, and two new endings","summary":"The demo update promised before Next Fest is live. Most of it comes from what you wrote on the discussion board and in reviews, and from watching people play: thank you.A longer demoThe demo now runs through the first six rings of the upgrade tree, about half an hour of play. The hole grows big enough for asteroids, and the Relativistic Jet joins your abilities.Abilities that go where the matter isSwarm. The mini-holes keep everything they catch and carry it all the way home.Relativistic Jet. Ea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T20:35:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225893","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:25:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5071280-1844751498218241","game_id":"steam-5071280","kind":"announcement","title":"The free Infall demo is out now, and the game launches November 10","summary":"The free demo of Infall is live: play it on Steam.It is the opening of the game. You start smaller than the dust around you, swallow your way through dust and comets, and buy your first abilities from the upgrade tree. It takes about fifteen minutes, and when the demo tree is done, the full game carries on from there.Infall launches November 10, 2026. Before that, it is part of Steam Next Fest, October 19 to 26.The discussion board is read every day. If something feels off, say so there: the dem","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T12:05:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218241","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:25:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5071280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:13Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5071280":"2026-10-26T07:59:13Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5071280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_c